                     <note>TBRC: W9780</note>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">jam dbyangs pad dkar zhal gyi bum bzang las/ /legs 'ongs dang po'i sangs rgyas sgrub pa'i thabs/ /rgyas 'bring bsdus pa bdud rtsir babs pa las/ /mdor bsdus la yang gdul bya'i mos pa bzhin/ rnam gsum rnal 'byor bzhi yi gnad tshang ba/ /rgyud 'grel dam pa rnams kyi man ngag ... //</incipit>
